<title>EGYPT: Egypt all-share index up 2.8 pct to record high.</title>
<headline>Egypt all-share index up 2.8 pct to record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index jumped 2.8 percent on Tuesday, to close at a record high of 346.58, from 337.04 on Monday. It was the third record close in as many days.</p>
<p>The Capital Market Authority said turnover was 66.6 million pounds ($19.6 million), slightly above average.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
